# that exist today.

# The domain package. Every level-3 and level-4 enforcement in the product ends up here:
# the single authorization evaluator (INV-AUTH-001), tenant scoping below the
# presentation layer (INV-TEN-004), version identity and immutability, effectivity,
# approval runs, the audit ledger's shape, and content canonicalisation.
